notes: "To try it, open the Editor and create a project, or open an existing deck.pptd. Then use Agent setup to copy the configuration for the AI client you already use. Start small: ask for one change to one slide, read the preview, apply it, and open the receipt. If you want to build or contribute, these three commands build and start the desktop editor from source, and the init command creates a new project folder without touching anything that already exists. The repository is listed at the bottom. This introduction is itself a HUANDENG project: open it, change a slide, and see your change in both of its Presentations. Thank you."
